# Changes to base/athena_defconfig (the 6.18.56 configuration), as scripts/config arguments, one call a
# line, applied before `make olddefconfig`.
#
# V4L2, for the JPEG encoder and the MDP3 (and a camera driver, where an overlay adds one).
--enable MEDIA_SUPPORT --enable VIDEO_DEV
# /proc/net/wireless, where programs read the Wi-Fi signal, comes with cfg80211's wireless extensions.
--enable CFG80211_WEXT
# The Mali-G72 (panfrost; the DTS's &gpu, enabled by patches/gpu-dts.py) and the JPEG encoder
# (mtk-jpeg, mt8183.dtsi's jpeg-encoder).
--enable DRM_PANFROST --enable VIDEO_MEDIATEK_JPEG
# The SCP (patches/scp-dts.py) and the MDP3 scaler/converter it plans for (patches/mdp3-mt8183-cros-abi.py).
--enable MTK_SCP --enable MTK_CMDQ --enable VIDEO_MEDIATEK_MDP3
# The SCP firmware's EC side: its console in debugfs (cros_scp/console_log), for when a block misbehaves.
--enable CROS_EC_RPMSG --enable CROS_EC_CHARDEV --enable CROS_EC_DEBUGFS
# A core that never comes back (stuck in the secure firmware) leaves the others feeding the hardware
# watchdog, and the unit wedged for good: the lockup detectors panic instead (as does an RCU stall, on
# pack.py's command line), and panic=5 reboots.
--enable SOFTLOCKUP_DETECTOR --set-val BOOTPARAM_SOFTLOCKUP_PANIC 1 --enable HARDLOCKUP_DETECTOR --enable BOOTPARAM_HARDLOCKUP_PANIC
